      "content": "idk i just feels like it might be a migraine since i had a headache earlier today... if it was a stroke wouldn't it be like way more intense than this? i feel mostly fine besides the vision stuff. u think i can just take some ibuprofen and wait it out for a few hours to see if it clears up? i really dont want to deal with the hospital if it's just a headache.",
